  "notes": "Almost exclusively used in the pattern ～に{長|た}けている. Rarely seen in other conjugated forms. Describes a developed, practical competence rather than innate talent.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ～に{長|た}けている (to be skilled at ~)\n- ～に{長|た}けた + noun (skilled at ~ [modifier])\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {交渉|こうしょう}に{長|た}けている (skilled at negotiation)\n- {技術|ぎじゅつ}に{長|た}けている (skilled in technology)\n- {弁舌|べんぜつ}に{長|た}けている (skilled in speech/rhetoric)",
